Unique  (cost=89.54..97.03 rows=999 width=8)
  ->  Sort  (cost=89.54..92.04 rows=999 width=8)
        Sort Key: ck DESC, k
        ->  Index Scan using a78_o_pkey on a78_o  (cost=0.29..39.77 rows=999 width=8)
              Index Cond: (k < 1000)
-- EXPLAIN

